target: cmd/looper/main.go
verify: go test ./cmd/looper/ -count=1 -run 'TestMutateSurvivorExitsNonZero'
expect: --- FAIL:
why:    the score and the survivor names are not printed, so CI output says nothing about what failed (The anchor was `report(...)` until internal/report arrived and the local function was renamed to printScore to stop shadowing the package — a rename makes an entry STALE, which scores as a failure, so the catalog run is what reports it.)
--- old
	printScore(out, results, len(muts))
--- new
	_ = printScore
